{title: Playa azul}
{artist: Los Amigos Invisibles}
{year: 2003}
{key: Ab}
{time: 4/4}

{define: Db base-fret 4 frets 3 2 1 1}
{define: Eb7 base-fret 1 frets 3 3 3 4}
{define: Fmaj7 base-fret 5 frets 1 1 0 0}
{define: Eb6 base-fret 1 frets 3 3 3 3}
{define: Bb base-fret 1 frets 3 2 1 1}
{define: Gdim7 base-fret 1 frets 0 1 0 4}
{define: B base-fret 1 frets 4 3 2 2}
{define: Bbm7 base-fret 1 frets 1 1 1 1}
{define: C7 base-fret 1 frets 0 0 0 1}
{define: Fm base-fret 3 frets 3 3 2 1}
{define: Ab base-fret 3 frets 3 1 2 1}
{define: Gb7 base-fret 1 frets 3 4 2 4}
{define: F7 base-fret 1 frets 2 3 1 0}
{define: Dbm7 base-fret 1 frets 4 4 4 4}

{start_of_verse: Intro}
[Db]   [Eb7]    [Db]   [Eb7] (x2)

[Fmaj7]      [Eb6]    [Bb]   [Gdim7]
[Fmaj7]      [Eb6]    [B]  [Bbm7]
[Db]   [Eb7]    [Eb6]    [Fm]
[Bb]·  · [C7]·  ·
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verso 1}
[Fmaj7]Quiero es[Eb6]tar [Bb] con[Gdim7]tigo en una
pla[Fmaj7]ya a[Eb6]zul, [B] o[Bbm7]yendo
bossano[Db]va y [Eb7]tú [Eb6] de[Fm]jándote
be[Bb]sar · [C7] ·
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verso 2}
[Fmaj7]Hoy so[Eb6]ñé [Bb] que [Gdim7]te acostabas
jun[Fmaj7]to a [Eb6]mí [B] son[Bbm7]riendo
me oí[Db]as de[Eb7]cir [Eb6] no [Fm]quiero
despertar[Bb] · [C7] ·
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Coro}
[Bbm7]Páaa-[Eb7]saaa-me un [Ab]ron [Gb7]-[F7]
[Bbm7]Pooon-[Eb7]le liii-[Ab]món [Gb7]-[F7]
[Bbm7]Haaaaa-[Dbm7]aaaaah
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verso 3}
[Fmaj7]Voy a ha[Eb6]blar [Bb]   [Gdim7]con un ángel
pa[Fmaj7]ra [Eb6]ver [B] si en [Bbm7]su ala
te po[Db]dría tra[Eb7]er [Eb6] y [Fm]nunca
regresar[Bb] · [C7] ·
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verso 4}
Porque [Fmaj7]quiero es[Eb6]tar [Bb] con[Gdim7]tigo en una
pla[Fmaj7]ya a[Eb6]zul, [B] qui[Bbm7]tándote
el bi[Db]kini y [Eb7]yo [Eb6] de[Fm]jándome
besar[Bb] · [C7] ·
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Coro 2}
[Bbm7]Páaa-[Eb7]saaa-me un [Ab]ron [Gb7]-[F7]
[Bbm7]Pooon-[Eb7]le liii-[Ab]món [Gb7]-[F7]
[Bbm7]Haaaaa-[Dbm7]aaaaah
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Solo}
[Db]   [Eb7]    [Db]   [Eb7] (x4)
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Bbm7]Quiero estar [Eb7] contigo en una pla[Ab]ya azul [Gb7]-mi[F7]rando el
horizon[Bbm7]te y tú [Eb7] dejándote besar[Ab]   [Gb7]-[F7]porque
[Bbm7]quiero estar... [Dbm7]
{end_of_verse}
